<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1) Lockdown was declared across the country by the central/state government(s) in response to COVID-19 pandemic on various dates between 22nd March, 2020 and 25th March, 2020. Consequently, Group's manufacturing and sales operations at all the locations were impacted due to such lockdown. The operations have commenced in a phased manner since April/May 2020 conforming to the guidelines of regulatory authorities. Disruption in operations as a result of the aforesaid, have impacted business performance during the quarter.  n  n2) The figures for the quarter ended 31st March, 2020, are the balancing figures between audited figures in respect of the full financial year and the unaudited published year to date figures upto nine months of the relevant financial year.  n  n3) Figures for previous periods have been regrouped/rearranged, wherever necessary.  n  n4) (a) The above results were reviewed by the Audit Committee on 6th August, 2020 and approved by the Board of Directors of the Company at its meeting held on 7th August, 2020. The above results have been reviewed by the Statutory Auditor of the Company.  n  n    (b) Key Standalone financial information:  n  nttttttttt( Rs.  in Crores)  nParticularstQuarter Ended t tYear Ended  nt30th June'20 (Unaudited)t t31st Mar'20 (Audited)  n(Refer Note 2)t t30th June'19 (Unaudited)t t31st Mar'20 (Audited)  nTotal Incomettt           791.86 t t             1,168.56 t t         1,313.09 tt        4,829.08   nNet Profit before Taxt              38.25 t t                110.64 t t            137.32 tt            421.12   nNet Profit after Taxt              27.97 t t                   91.37 t t            102.16 t t            315.84</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
